      "filename": "Karl Brullov - The Last Day of Pompeii - Google Art Project.jpg",
      "title": "File:Karl Brullov - The Last Day of Pompeii - Google Art Project.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/Karl_Brullov_-_The_Last_Day_of_Pompeii_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg",
